 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dSNjmR1zV1UQ7kNvwGwdq6v&_nc_oc=AdrN4wsodXrcNiYgQ3S2Wz_Mj1Zc4S4EwuYMONMw0JWkbP7CQyRqULK-2EzFSBZUY2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCTBAzEWH1RkafSsim_ssComvwih3W_7UKWvwpN_ZXtQ&oe=6AAFF941"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRBgfHQB4FEQ7kNvwFhd8FC&_nc_oc=Adq16qv6e00E_9mxJQDag38UoGuu6rmu91U_aSNeI3AV1C9mec0utNDVphbBjo7T2qM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJcyaINHZST-g-r1NhI3KMzUhfkVpGZSnieJnqrzwEh5Q&oe=6AB006A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-MnbxfVzEwQ7kNvwFzIhAN&_nc_oc=AdrM7Nm7VEkdp9wgqCVe6wdcTsCLDIKIYqRl4goErfWZtOmVMWEm6yDXjQcDxw3QZKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK8-4xLgJqnKKxx-G-E0aU4yjElkn7Ue_GrWRVyK42FVQ&oe=6AAFD85C"}, {"fil